"Language: ko\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:392
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Yer Money vs Yor Life"
msgstr "돈이냐 목숨이냐"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Bandits catch "
msgstr "약탈자들이 기습한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " by surprise, in a really terrible spot for "
msgstr ". 장소가 최악이다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" to fight in.\r\n"
"\tThey demand that all food and "
msgstr ""
"이(가) 싸우기엔 너무 불리하다.\r\n"
"\t놈들은 식량 전부와 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" supplies are handed over!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 물자를 모두 내놓으라고 요구한다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "YER MONEY OR YOR LIFE!"
msgstr "돈이냐 목숨이냐!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:399
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Give up supplies"
msgstr "물자를 내준다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:405
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ": We can fight them!"
msgstr ": 싸울 수 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:407
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "Run for it!"
msgstr "도망쳐!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" decides to plow the car right through the bandit roadblock and Lord Humungoid.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 약탈자의 바리케이드와 휴먼고이드 경을 차로 그대로 들이받기로 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:6
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " take"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:6
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " a lot of damage, but survive"
msgstr "큰 피해를 입지만, 살아남는다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " figured out a plan during the speech."
msgstr "은(는) 연설하는 동안 계획을 세웠다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" starts honking the horn. The bandits are amused by the sight of an animal "
"doing this. They decide to let "
msgstr "는 경적을 울리기 시작한다. 약탈자들은 동물이 이러는 모습이 재밌는지 보내 주기로 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " pass. All part of the plan!"
msgstr "을(를). 다 계획대로다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" suddenly jams on the gas pedal and turns hard. The car shoots through a small gap in the roadblock, then keeps going. \r\n"
"\t\tBy the time the bandits react, "
msgstr ""
"는 갑자기 액셀을 밟고 핸들을 확 꺾는다. 차가 바리케이드의 작은 틈으로 빠져나가 그대로 달린다. \r\n"
"\t\t약탈자들이 반응했을 땐 이미 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " already has too much of a head start to be worth chasing."
msgstr "이(가) 너무 멀리 가 버려서 쫓을 가치도 없다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "After a dramatic pause, "
msgstr "극적인 정적 끝에, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " farts. It echoes."
msgstr "은(는) 방귀를 뀐다. 메아리친다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " tells Lord Humungoid to"
msgstr "은(는) 휴먼고이드 경에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:23
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:83
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " COOL IT."
msgstr " 진정해."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"Lord Humungoid has a huge change of heart.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"휴먼고이드 경의 마음이 크게 바뀐다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"THERE HAS BEEN TOO MUCH VIOLENCE... TOO MUCH PAIN. BUT I HAVE AN HONORABLE "
"COMPROMISE!"
msgstr "폭력이 너무 많았다... 고통도 너무 많았다. 하지만 나에게 명예로운 타협안이 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tHe offers a gift and safe passage!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그는 선물과 안전한 통행을 약속한다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Lord Humungoid doesn't like this. The bandits take the car and all of "
msgstr "휴먼고이드 경은 그게 마음에 안 든다. 약탈자들이 차를 빼앗고, 찾아낸 물자도 모두 가져간다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "'s supplies that they find."
msgstr "의 물자를."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" gets out of the car and walks away unharmed. Lord Humungoid's last words "
"before peeling out in "
msgstr "은(는) 차에서 내려 무사히 걸어 나간다. 휴먼고이드 경이 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "'s car are "
msgstr "의 차를 몰고 사라지며 남긴 마지막 말: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "SMELL YA LATER, NERDS!"
msgstr "잘 가라, 찐따들아!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Car Collecting Bandits"
msgstr "차 수집 약탈자"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"Bandits have blocked the narrow road ahead with their cars. Their leader, "
msgstr "약탈자들이 차로 앞쪽 좁은 길을 막았다. 두목인 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Lord Humungoid"
msgstr "휴먼고이드 경"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" speaks:\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 말한다:\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"JUST WALK AWAY! GIVE ME YOUR CAR! YOUR OIL! THE GASOLINE! AND I WILL SPARE YOUR LIVES.\r\n"
"\tI AWAIT YOUR ANSWER."
msgstr ""
"그냥 걸어서 떠나라! 차를 내놔라! 오일도! 휘발유도! 그러면 목숨은 살려 주마.\r\n"
"\t대답을 기다리겠다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Give up the car and all gas"
msgstr "차와 기름을 전부 내준다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " already has a plan"
msgstr "은(는) 이미 계획이 있다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:53
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:120
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:226
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " tells Bandits to 'Cool It'"
msgstr "이(가) 약탈자들에게 '진정해'라고 말한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Plow through them!"
msgstr "뚫고 지나간다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " offers to heal the injured bandit with "
msgstr "은(는) 다친 약탈자를 치료해 주겠다고 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " medical know-how. "
msgstr " 의학 지식으로. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " fixes things right up! The bandits let "
msgstr "는 깔끔하게 고쳐 준다! 약탈자들이 보내 준다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:63
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " go."
msgstr "을(를)."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " ends up making things worse! The bandits aren't very happy."
msgstr "는 오히려 상태를 악화시킨다! 약탈자들은 별로 기쁘지 않다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " knew that something was very wrong the whole time. Due to "
msgstr "은(는) 처음부터 뭔가 이상하다는 걸 알았다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "ing, "
msgstr " 덕분에, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " is warned early. "
msgstr "은(는) 미리 경고를 받는다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " ready to fight before the bandits are, and escape unharmed."
msgstr "약탈자들보다 먼저 싸울 준비를 마치고, 무사히 탈출한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Always suspicious, "
msgstr "늘 의심이 많은 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " hid the car and supplies before approaching the settlement. "
msgstr "은(는) 정착지에 다가가기 전에 차와 물자를 숨겨 뒀다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" claims to have nothing of value.\r\n"
"\t\tThe bandits doubt this, but can't find anything. They end up letting "
msgstr ""
"는 가진 게 없다고 주장한다.\r\n"
"\t\t약탈자들은 의심하지만 아무것도 찾지 못한다. 결국 보내 준다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " farts in a pitch that sounds like a tiny violin."
msgstr "은(는) 작은 바이올린 소리 같은 음정으로 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " tells the fake traders to "
msgstr "은(는) 가짜 상인들에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"The injured bandit looks really moved by this!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"다친 약탈자는 진심으로 감동한 것 같다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "WOW! I feel so much better now!"
msgstr "와! 훨씬 나아졌어!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe stands up, does a cartwheel, and orders that you be brought a gift!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀는 일어나 옆구르기를 한 번 하고는 선물을 가져오라고 명령한다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "The bandits just stare at the "
msgstr "약탈자들은 한참 동안 그냥 쳐다본다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" for awhile.\r\n"
"\t\tThen they take most of "
msgstr ""
"을(를).\r\n"
"\t\t그러고는 대부분 가져간다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " supplies."
msgstr " 물자를."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Trader Trap"
msgstr "상인 함정"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " checks out what appears to be a trader settlement. "
msgstr "은(는) 상인 정착지처럼 보이는 곳을 살펴본다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" instead ambushed by bandits who have taken it over. One of them looks injured.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"오히려 그곳을 점거한 약탈자들에게 매복당한다. 한 명은 다친 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:105
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "They demand "
msgstr "요구하는 것: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "... oh wait, it's just an animal. False alarm!"
msgstr "... 아 잠깐, 그냥 동물이네. 잘못 봤다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t\tThe bandits let "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t\t약탈자들이 보내 준다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " go!"
msgstr "을(를)!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "8 medical supplies!"
msgstr "의약품 8개!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:114
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Give them 8 medical supplies"
msgstr "의약품 8개를 준다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " offers to heal injury"
msgstr "이(가) 치료를 제안한다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " saw this coming"
msgstr "은(는) 이럴 줄 알았다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:132
#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:135
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " felt suspicious about the campsite, so "
msgstr "은(는) 야영지가 수상하다고 느껴서, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " left the car running. "
msgstr "가 차 시동을 켜 둔 채로 두었다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" pretends to give in to their demands, but runs to the waiting car as soon "
"as "
msgstr "는 요구에 응하는 척하다가, 틈이 나자마자 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" can.\r\n"
"\t\tThe bandits' weapons are too crappy to do anything to the car once "
msgstr ""
"가 대기 중인 차로 달려간다.\r\n"
"\t\t약탈자들의 무기는 너무 조잡해서 일단 차에 타면 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "'s in, so "
msgstr "에게 아무 피해도 못 준다. 그래서 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " PEELS OUT."
msgstr "는 급출발로 내뺀다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:135
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" wanted to wait near the car.\r\n"
"\t\tAs "
msgstr ""
"는 차 근처에서 기다리고 싶어 했다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" is being robbed, the car barrels through the campsite, plows over a tent, "
"and then stops. The bandits are freaked out, so they flee!"
msgstr "이(가) 털리는 동안, 차가 야영지를 뚫고 돌진해 텐트를 밟고 멈춘다. 약탈자들은 기겁해서 도망친다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " accidentally locked "
msgstr "은(는) 실수로 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "self in the car and barks to be let out."
msgstr "자신을 차 안에 가둬 버리고 내보내 달라고 짖는다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " is not sure if "
msgstr "은(는) 확신이 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " did all this on purpose or not."
msgstr "이(가) 이걸 일부러 한 건지 아닌지."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " is really surprised "
msgstr "은(는) 정말 놀란다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " didn't try to steal the car. "
msgstr "이(가) 차를 훔치려 하지 않았다는 사실에. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " looks nervous for a moment."
msgstr "는 잠깐 긴장한 표정을 짓는다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " farts and makes a really big deal about it."
msgstr "은(는) 방귀를 뀌고 그걸로 엄청 생색을 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " tells the bandits to"
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게 말한다:"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:159
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits really take this to heart.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"약탈자들은 이 말을 진심으로 받아들인다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Yeah! Who needs weapons when we got friendship?"
msgstr "그래! 우정이 있는데 무기가 왜 필요해?"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThey offer a gift!"
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그들은 선물을 건넨다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "The bandits all start attacking "
msgstr "약탈자들이 모두 공격하기 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ". They forget about the weapons."
msgstr ". 무기 따위는 잊어버린다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " fights the bandits with "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들과 싸운다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " strength!"
msgstr " 힘으로!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" decides to take their chances in a fight.\r\n"
"\t\tThe bandits' weapons are crude, but they're still dangerous."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 싸움에 운을 걸어 보기로 한다.\r\n"
"\t\t약탈자들의 무기는 조잡하지만 그래도 위험하다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " ends up giving all "
msgstr "은(는) 결국 몽땅 넘긴다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" weapons to the bandits.\r\n"
"\tThe bandits give "
msgstr ""
" 무기를 약탈자들에게.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들은 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:189
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " him some old weapons, maybe feeling some guilt."
msgstr "에게 낡은 무기 몇 개를 준다. 양심에 좀 찔렸나 보다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " aims "
msgstr "은(는) 겨눈다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" weapon at lightning speeds and blasts all the bandits' flimsy weapons apart.\r\n"
"\tThe bandits start running!"
msgstr ""
" 무기를 번개 같은 속도로. 약탈자들의 허술한 무기를 전부 날려 버린다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들이 도망치기 시작한다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:201
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " casually explains with the power of "
msgstr "은(는) 태연하게 설명한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:201
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "GUNGINEER SACRED TECH"
msgstr "총기 기술자의 신성한 기술"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:201
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " that the bandit's weapons will jam."
msgstr "의 힘으로 약탈자들의 무기가 걸릴 거라고."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"HEY DORKS! NICE GUNS...FOR A FIVE YEAR OLD! SHAME YOU PUT GUM IN THE "
"CYLINDERS!"
msgstr "야 바보들아! 총 좋네... 다섯 살짜리한테나! 탄창에 껌 넣은 건 유감이다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"The bandits turn to one another, embarrassed and overwhelmed. Maybe this was"
" a horrible idea after all! In the ensuing moral panic, the group forces "
"their surrender."
msgstr ""
"약탈자들은 서로를 쳐다보며 창피해하고 당황한다. 애초에 끔찍한 생각이었나 보다! 이어진 도덕적 공황 속에 일행은 그들의 항복을 받아 "
"낸다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"Ordinarily, this wouldn't work on an experienced bandit. But the tinker-"
"gungineer type is always watching your craftsmanship. "
msgstr "보통은 노련한 약탈자에게 이런 게 안 통한다. 하지만 땜장이 총기 기술자는 늘 너의 솜씨를 지켜보고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " knows your sins. ALWAYS."
msgstr "는 너의 죄를 안다. 언제나."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:212
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Weapon Stealing Bandits"
msgstr "무기 도둑 약탈자"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "As "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " explores a campsite, "
msgstr "이(가) 야영지를 살펴보는데, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:213
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" ambushed by bandits. They brandish makeshift weapons.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"약탈자들에게 매복당한다. 놈들은 조잡한 무기를 휘두른다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "They demand all of your weapons."
msgstr "놈들은 무기를 전부 내놓으라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tThis is ludicrous. Not even bandits will usually do this, as it's a slow but sure death sentence."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t터무니없다. 약탈자들도 보통 이런 짓은 안 한다. 서서히 확실하게 죽으라는 소리니까."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " quickdraws and fires"
msgstr "이(가) 속사로 쏜다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Fight the bandits!"
msgstr "약탈자와 싸운다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " left the car running"
msgstr "은(는) 차 시동을 켜 뒀다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " comes to the rescue"
msgstr "이(가) 구하러 온다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " knows something they don't"
msgstr "은(는) 놈들이 모르는 걸 안다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Give up all of the weapons!"
msgstr "무기를 전부 내준다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " is sent to distract the bandits so they leave their car checkpoint."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들이 검문소를 비우도록 주의를 끄는 역할을 맡는다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " instantly turns on "
msgstr "은(는) 즉시 배신한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " and joins the bandits, instead."
msgstr ". 그리고 약탈자 편에 붙는다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " is attacked! "
msgstr "은(는) 공격받는다! "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " attempt"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " to escape..."
msgstr "탈출을 시도한다..."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " doesn't sell "
msgstr "은(는) 팔아넘기지 않는다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " out to the bandits! "
msgstr "을(를) 약탈자들에게! "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" distracts them from afar and runs. They give chase, and the car is able to "
"get past."
msgstr "는 멀리서 놈들의 주의를 끌고 도망친다. 놈들이 쫓아가는 사이 차가 빠져나간다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " panics while retreating. "
msgstr "은(는) 후퇴하다가 당황한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " ends up not following the plan right, and gets hurt!"
msgstr "는 계획대로 하지 못하고 다친다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " sneaks around the checkpoint later, and rejoins "
msgstr "은(는) 나중에 검문소를 몰래 돌아서 다시 합류한다: "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" decides to plow the car right through the checkpoint.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차로 검문소를 그대로 들이받기로 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Plow the car through!"
msgstr "차로 들이받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " made a backup plan before being spotted."
msgstr "은(는) 발각되기 전에 예비 계획을 세워 뒀다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " retreats to a ruined building, where the bandits can't see "
msgstr "는 폐건물로 물러난다. 약탈자들에게서 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ". When they get closer, "
msgstr "가 안 보이는 곳이다. 놈들이 가까이 오자, "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " jumps out through a back window, sneaks "
msgstr "는 뒤쪽 창문으로 뛰어나가 몰래 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " way to the car, and escapes through a now empty checkpoint!"
msgstr " 차로 가서 텅 빈 검문소를 통과해 탈출한다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:268
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Who should be sent to distract the bandits?"
msgstr "누구를 보내서 약탈자들의 주의를 끌까?"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:273
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Who can be trusted?"
msgstr "누굴 믿을 수 있을까?"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:275
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " a group of bandits that have set up a checkpoint on the road. "
msgstr "은(는) 도로에 검문소를 세운 약탈자 무리를 발견한다. "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:275
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" has no good way to distract them, and eventually gets spotted.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"는 주의를 끌 좋은 방법이 없고, 결국 발각된다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " has a plan to trick them"
msgstr "은(는) 놈들을 속일 계획이 있다"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:285
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" spots a group of bandits that have set up a checkpoint on the road. Someone from the team could be sent to distract the bandits so the car can get through. \r\n"
"\t\tIt would have to be someone calm and "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 도로에 검문소를 세운 약탈자 무리를 발견한다. 일행 중 하나를 보내 주의를 끌면 차가 지나갈 수 있다. \r\n"
"\t\t침착하고 "

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "trustworthy"
msgstr "믿을 수 있는"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " decides that the spot looks TOO safe and "
msgstr "은(는) 이 장소가 너무 안전해 보인다고 판단하고, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" ends up PEELING OUT of there, fast, without eating or sleeping.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"는 먹지도 자지도 않고 재빨리 그곳을 떠난다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "'s feels smug in knowing "
msgstr "은(는) 뿌듯하다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " avoided that threat."
msgstr "가 그 위협을 피했다는 게."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " decides that there's DANGER AFOOT so "
msgstr "은(는) 위험이 도사리고 있다고 판단하고, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" starts barking at nothing and then never, ever stops until well into the "
"next morning."
msgstr "는 아무것도 없는 곳을 향해 짖기 시작해서 다음 날 아침까지 절대 멈추지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" sets up camp in this boring but safe looking spot.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 지루하지만 안전해 보이는 이곳에 야영을 한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Boring Stop"
msgstr "지루한 휴식"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" finds an empty spot along the road that looks as good for camping as any.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길가에서 야영하기에 무난한 빈 공터를 찾는다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "The weather is clear and there's no sign of danger in any direction."
msgstr "날씨는 맑고 어느 방향에도 위험의 기미가 없다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Eat and Rest"
msgstr "먹고 쉰다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ": Can't fool me!"
msgstr ": 날 속일 순 없어!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" swaps stories with pals and it's a very morale-boosting team-building experience despite everyone else being imaginary.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 친구들과 이야기를 나눈다. 다른 사람들이 다 상상 속 인물이긴 하지만 사기가 크게 오르는 팀워크 경험이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " forgets all about the marshmallows, and they get left behind!"
msgstr "은(는) 마시멜로를 까맣게 잊어버리고 두고 간다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" swaps stories about themselves. They learn a lot about each other, but "
"forget all about the marshmallows!"
msgstr "은(는) 서로에 대한 이야기를 나눈다. 서로를 많이 알게 되지만, 마시멜로는 까맣게 잊어버린다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" sets up camp, then eats a huge bag of marshmallows instead of eating "
"dinner. There's even some left over!"
msgstr "은(는) 야영을 하고, 저녁 대신 마시멜로 한 봉지를 통째로 먹는다. 남기까지 했다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Old Campground"
msgstr "오래된 야영장"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " finds an abandoned campground with a fire pit. "
msgstr "은(는) 모닥불 자리가 있는 버려진 야영장을 찾는다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" even finds an old, somewhat stale extra-large pack of marshmallows!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 오래돼서 좀 눅눅한 특대 마시멜로 한 봉지까지 찾아낸다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Eat Marshmallows"
msgstr "마시멜로를 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Tell Stories"
msgstr "이야기를 나눈다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Quick Stop"
msgstr "짧은 휴식"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "After a long drive, "
msgstr "긴 운전 끝에, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" finds a safe place to camp. The night passes with no incidents.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 안전한 야영지를 찾는다. 밤은 아무 일 없이 지나간다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Passing Out"
msgstr "기절하듯 잠들다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Exhausted after an extra long drive, "
msgstr "유난히 긴 운전으로 지친 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" scouts out a camping spot and falls asleep immediately after.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 야영지를 찾자마자 바로 곯아떨어진다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Darn It"
msgstr "젠장"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " Next morning, "
msgstr " 다음 날 아침, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" goes to siphon the cars, but notices a large horde of zombies approaching and the gas has to be abandoned.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차에서 기름을 빼러 가지만, 커다란 좀비 무리가 다가오는 걸 보고 기름을 포기한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Gassy Night"
msgstr "기름진 밤"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " tries to siphon some gas, but finds that "
msgstr "은(는) 기름을 빼 보려 하지만, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " body structure is really poorly suited for it."
msgstr " 몸 구조가 그 일에 전혀 맞지 않는다는 걸 깨닫는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" siphons the gas, but accidentally swallows a bit and gets really, really "
"sick that night instead of sleeping."
msgstr "은(는) 기름을 빼다가 실수로 조금 삼켜서, 그날 밤 잠 대신 지독하게 앓는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Who should siphon out the gas?"
msgstr "누가 기름을 빼 올까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Night Siphon"
msgstr "한밤의 기름 빼기"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid ""
" sets up camp late. On the nearby highway is a bunch of abandoned cars. They're broken, but many should have a little bit of gas.\r\n"
"\tWould you like to send someone to siphon out the gas?"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 늦게 야영을 한다. 근처 고속도로에 버려진 차가 잔뜩 있다. 다 고장 났지만, 기름은 조금씩 남아 있을 것이다.\r\n"
"\t누구를 보내서 기름을 빼 올까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "Wait until morning"
msgstr "아침까지 기다린다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "The worst of the zombie siege is over. "
msgstr "좀비 포위전의 최악은 지나갔다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" clears out any remaining zombies outside, then goes back in to splat any "
"stragglers so "
msgstr "은(는) 밖에 남은 좀비를 정리하고, 안에 남은 낙오자들도 박살 낸다. 그래야 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " can set up camp."
msgstr "이(가) 야영을 할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Mini Golf!"
msgstr "미니 골프!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" sets up camp at the safest place they could find around: an abandoned mini-"
"golf park. "
msgstr "은(는) 주변에서 찾을 수 있는 가장 안전한 곳에 야영을 한다: 버려진 미니 골프장. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "In the morning, "
msgstr "아침에, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " find"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " a golf ball and putter while searching the area. "
msgstr "주변을 뒤지다 골프공과 퍼터를 찾는다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " decides to play a quick game!"
msgstr "은(는) 한 게임 하기로 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " runs around in excitement!"
msgstr "은(는) 신나서 뛰어다닌다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " gets some needed exercise!"
msgstr "은(는) 필요했던 운동을 좀 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " gets tired of the game and then loses the ball on purpose."
msgstr "은(는) 게임에 질려서 일부러 공을 잃어버린다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " accidentally bites through the ball."
msgstr "은(는) 실수로 공을 물어 터뜨린다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " accidentally destroys the putter."
msgstr "은(는) 실수로 퍼터를 부숴 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " accidentally hits the ball so far that it gets lost."
msgstr "은(는) 실수로 공을 너무 멀리 쳐서 잃어버린다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " decides to flee the golf course. "
msgstr "은(는) 골프장에서 도망치기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" end up not finding another good place to sleep, and drive for most of the "
"night. "
msgstr "은(는) 결국 잘 곳을 못 찾고 밤새 운전한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " are very tired the next day."
msgstr "은(는) 다음 날 몹시 피곤하다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " attempts to play golf, but it's difficult to do this as a "
msgstr "은(는) 골프를 쳐 보려 하지만 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" maybe could have done it with a caddy.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"(이)라서 쉽지 않다. 캐디가 있었으면 몰라도.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " is completely overwhelmed."
msgstr "은(는) 완전히 압도당한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" clubs a bunch of golf balls into zombie heads. It's pretty good exercise, "
"but soon "
msgstr "은(는) 골프공을 좀비 머리에 연달아 날린다. 꽤 좋은 운동이지만 곧 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" is overwhelmed by them.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"는 좀비들에게 압도당한다.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " escapes, but spends the night hiding in a closet. "
msgstr "는 탈출하지만 밤새 벽장에 숨어 지낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " is exhausted in the morning."
msgstr "는 아침에 녹초가 된다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" picks up a bunch of clubs and gets some buckets of golf balls. They start "
"driving shots down the range as the zombies close in."
msgstr "은(는) 골프채와 골프공 바구니를 챙긴다. 좀비가 다가오는 동안 연습장에서 공을 쳐 날린다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "They send golf ball after golf ball into the incoming horde."
msgstr "다가오는 무리를 향해 골프공을 계속 날린다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
"The team beans the zombies from across the range. They never even get close!"
msgstr "일행은 연습장 너머에서 좀비들의 머리를 맞힌다. 좀비들은 근처에도 못 온다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
"The zombies get pelted by golf balls, but they're not hit hard enough to get"
" slowed down much. The team ends up fighting them normally."
msgstr "좀비들이 골프공에 맞지만, 세게 맞지 않아서 별로 느려지지 않는다. 결국 평소처럼 싸우게 된다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "It's hard work, and the team mostly just tires themselves out. "
msgstr "힘든 일이라 일행은 대부분 지치기만 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " are overwhelmed by the zombies."
msgstr "은(는) 좀비들에게 압도당한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" jumps into a golf ball collector and starts running over zombies.\r\n"
"\tIt's surprisingly effective. By the time the collector breaks down, most of the zombies are taken care of."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 골프공 수거차에 뛰어올라 좀비들을 치기 시작한다.\r\n"
"\t의외로 효과적이다. 수거차가 고장 날 무렵엔 좀비 대부분이 처리됐다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
"The zombies start hitting the door of the pro shop. There's not much time to"
" prepare before the door breaks!"
msgstr "좀비들이 프로숍 문을 두드리기 시작한다. 문이 부서지기 전까지 준비할 시간이 별로 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Try to Survive"
msgstr "살아남아라"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Driving Range Last Stand"
msgstr "골프 연습장 최후의 저항"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " camps out in a pro shop near a golf course. "
msgstr "은(는) 골프장 근처 프로숍에서 야영한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" looks out the window and sees a large group of zombies approaching from the driving range!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 창밖을 보다가 연습장 쪽에서 큰 좀비 무리가 다가오는 걸 본다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " hotwires a golf ball collector"
msgstr "이(가) 골프공 수거차를 직결로 시동 건다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Shoot golf balls at the zombies"
msgstr "좀비에게 골프공을 쏜다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Prepare for Siege!"
msgstr "포위전 준비!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Drive away with no sleep"
msgstr "잠 안 자고 차로 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " endures the "
msgstr "은(는) 견딘다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:104 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "SMELL ZONE"
msgstr "악취 구역"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " all night, until passing out. "
msgstr "을(를) 밤새, 기절할 때까지. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " not happy in the morning, but "
msgstr "아침에 기분은 별로지만, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " at least able to sleep."
msgstr "그래도 잠은 잤다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " gets out of the "
msgstr "은(는) 벗어난다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:109 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " get"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " no sleep, yet feel"
msgstr "잠은 못 잤지만, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " like leaving was the right choice."
msgstr "떠난 게 옳은 선택이었다고 느낀다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:114
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Smelly Campsite"
msgstr "악취 나는 야영지"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:115 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "The campground that "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:115
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" sets up smells terrible! The source of the smell is a complete mystery."
msgstr "이(가) 자리 잡은 야영지에서 지독한 냄새가 난다! 냄새의 근원은 완전히 미스터리다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Endure the smell"
msgstr "냄새를 견딘다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:117 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:424
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Drive off with no sleep"
msgstr "잠 안 자고 차로 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Creepy Campsite"
msgstr "으스스한 야영지"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" stumbles on is very eerie. It's hard to place why it's so unsettling.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 우연히 들어선 야영지는 아주 으스스하다. 왜 이렇게 불안한지 딱 꼬집어 말하기 어렵다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " no sleep, and feel"
msgstr "잠은 못 잤고, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " off even after leaving."
msgstr "떠난 뒤에도 기분이 찜찜하다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" refuses to camp in a dangerous area, and spends a tense and sleepless night driving through the dark.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 위험한 곳에서 야영하길 거부하고, 어둠 속을 달리며 긴장되고 잠 못 이루는 밤을 보낸다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "The car veers off the road and crashes into a tree."
msgstr "차가 도로를 벗어나 나무에 처박힌다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:136
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " stands guard for the night."
msgstr "은(는) 밤새 보초를 선다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" ignores the task and falls asleep almost instantly. The next morning, a "
"bunch of supplies are missing."
msgstr "는 맡은 일을 무시하고 거의 바로 잠든다. 다음 날 아침, 물자 여러 개가 사라졌다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " manages to stay awake, but feels pretty bad in the morning."
msgstr "는 깨어 있는 데 성공했지만, 아침에 몸 상태가 꽤 나쁘다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:148 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:204
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Who should stay up on watch?"
msgstr "누가 보초를 설까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Bandit Watch"
msgstr "약탈자 경계"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
"It's nearly time to camp, but there has been a lot of signs of bandits today. Someone needs to be awake in case of an attack.\r\n"
"\tWho should stay up on watch?"
msgstr ""
"야영할 시간이 다 됐는데, 오늘 약탈자 흔적이 많았다. 습격에 대비해 누군가는 깨어 있어야 한다.\r\n"
"\t누가 보초를 설까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:159 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Keep driving"
msgstr "계속 달린다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " decides to go to sleep, betting that the zombies won't find "
msgstr "은(는) 좀비들이 못 찾을 거라 믿고 그냥 자기로 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" wakes up in the middle of being eaten by a small group of zombies. With no "
"one to help "
msgstr "는 좀비 몇 마리에게 뜯어 먹히는 와중에 깬다. 도와줄 사람 하나 없이 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ", it's hard to break free."
msgstr " 혼자서는 빠져나오기 힘들다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " sleeps through the night with no interruption."
msgstr "는 한 번도 깨지 않고 푹 잔다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " takes turns sleeping during the night."
msgstr "은(는) 밤새 돌아가며 잔다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " is very tired in the morning, and "
msgstr "은(는) 아침에 몹시 피곤하고, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " didn't sleep great either."
msgstr "도 잠을 잘 못 잤다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "With a full group, there's enough people to still get plenty of sleep!"
msgstr "일행이 꽉 차 있으니 충분히 잘 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " stands watch for roving zombies."
msgstr "은(는) 돌아다니는 좀비를 경계하며 보초를 선다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" stops paying attention and wanders off in the middle of standing guard. "
msgstr "는 보초를 서다 정신이 팔려 어디론가 가 버린다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " is ambushed by zombies, but manages to fight them off."
msgstr "이(가) 좀비에게 기습당하지만, 겨우 물리친다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " falls asleep almost instantly. "
msgstr "는 거의 바로 잠든다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " wakes up in the middle of being eaten."
msgstr "이(가) 뜯어 먹히는 와중에 깬다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " manages to stay awake, but feels groggy in the morning."
msgstr "는 깨어 있는 데 성공했지만, 아침에 비몽사몽이다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Zombie Watch"
msgstr "좀비 경계"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
"It gets late, and there's no great place to camp. Solo zombies hobble around"
" in the far distance, and one might sneak up on "
msgstr ""
"날이 저물었는데 마땅히 야영할 곳이 없다. 저 멀리 좀비들이 하나둘 절뚝거리며 돌아다니고, 그중 하나가 몰래 다가올지도 모른다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " while "
msgstr "이(가) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " sleep"
msgstr "자는 동안"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
".\r\n"
"\tWho should stay up on watch?"
msgstr ""
".\r\n"
"\t누가 보초를 설까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Sleep anyway"
msgstr "그냥 잔다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Take shifts"
msgstr "교대로 잔다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" picks berries all night and puts them into whatever containers are handy."
msgstr "은(는) 밤새 베리를 따서 손에 잡히는 그릇마다 담는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:234
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " really doesn't want to pick berries for 8 hours."
msgstr "은(는) 8시간 동안 베리를 따고 싶지 않다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Berry Picking in Zombie Games"
msgstr "좀비 게임 속 베리 따기"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " sets up camp for the night after being sure there's no danger here."
msgstr "은(는) 위험이 없다는 걸 확인한 뒤 야영을 한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " discover"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" edible berry bushes all around the campsite!\r\n"
"\t\t\r\n"
"\t\tThe berries wouldn't be a big amount of food for the work and the sleepless night, but every bit could help."
msgstr ""
"야영지 주변에 먹을 수 있는 베리 덤불이 가득하다는 걸 발견한다!\r\n"
"\t\t\r\n"
"\t\t고생하고 밤까지 새우는 것에 비하면 양은 많지 않겠지만, 조금이라도 도움이 될 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Pick berries all night"
msgstr "밤새 베리를 딴다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Go to sleep"
msgstr "잔다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "GOBLINS!!!!"
msgstr "고블린!!!!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "SKELETONS!!"
msgstr "해골!!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "BAD SMELLS!"
msgstr "악취!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "HUGE FARTS!"
msgstr "엄청난 방귀!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "DIARRHEA!!!"
msgstr "설사!!!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "TINY GHOSTS!"
msgstr "꼬마 유령!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:260
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "A TURTLE!!!"
msgstr "거북이!!!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "MEAN CATS!!"
msgstr "사나운 고양이!!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "CAR REPAIR!"
msgstr "자동차 수리!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "YAPPY DOGS!"
msgstr "시끄러운 개!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "EVIL GOBLINS!"
msgstr "사악한 고블린!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "DANCING SKELETONS!"
msgstr "춤추는 해골!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "PEANUT ALLERGIES!"
msgstr "땅콩 알레르기!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "LAUGHING GOBLINS!!!"
msgstr "웃는 고블린!!!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:268
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "GOBLINS!!"
msgstr "고블린!!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "MENACING GOBLINS!"
msgstr "위협적인 고블린!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:274
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " decides to tell scary stories!"
msgstr "은(는) 무서운 이야기를 하기로 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "But it turns out that "
msgstr "하지만 알고 보니 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " was alone, "
msgstr "은(는) 혼자였다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
"TELLING THE SCARY STORIES TO GHOSTS!\r\n"
"\t\tWHOOOOOAAAAAAA!"
msgstr ""
"유령들에게 무서운 이야기를 하고 있었던 거다!\r\n"
"\t\t우오오오오오오!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " mostly "
msgstr "은(는) 주로 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "s a lot but in a "
msgstr " 소리를 잔뜩 내지만, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "SCARY WAY!"
msgstr "무서운 방식으로!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " makes "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " scary story about "
msgstr " 무서운 이야기를 지어낸다. 주제: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:287
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " has fun, but doesn't get enough sleep and is tired the next day."
msgstr "은(는) 즐거웠지만, 잠이 부족해서 다음 날 피곤하다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:292
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "No More Creepypastas"
msgstr "이제 괴담은 그만"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " is sitting around a campfire, resting before a brutal day tomorrow."
msgstr "은(는) 모닥불 주위에 앉아 혹독한 내일을 앞두고 쉬고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:295
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Tell Scary Stories"
msgstr "무서운 이야기를 한다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:296 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:349
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Just go to sleep"
msgstr "그냥 잔다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " thought the weather was nice!"
msgstr "은(는) 날씨가 좋다고 생각했다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:307
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " didn't mind it much."
msgstr "은(는) 별로 개의치 않았다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Miserable Camping"
msgstr "비참한 야영"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:316
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" couldn't find any safe shelters, but was able to cobble together a "
"campsite. The weather is terrible all night!"
msgstr "은(는) 안전한 피난처를 못 찾았지만, 어찌어찌 야영지를 꾸렸다. 밤새 날씨가 끔찍하다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:329
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" chops a bunch of wood and gets the woodstove going before passing out from exhaustion.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 장작을 잔뜩 패서 장작 난로를 피운 뒤 지쳐 쓰러진다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " will be very tired tomorrow!"
msgstr "는 내일 몹시 피곤할 것이다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:332
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "The fire feels great!"
msgstr "불이 정말 따뜻하다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:340
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Who should go chop the wood? It's really hard work!"
msgstr "누가 장작을 팰까? 정말 힘든 일이다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:346
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Cabin with Woodstove"
msgstr "장작 난로가 있는 오두막"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:347
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" finds a cabin in the woods, with no zombies in sight. It has a woodstove in"
" it, but no wood!"
msgstr "은(는) 숲속에서 좀비 하나 없는 오두막을 찾는다. 장작 난로는 있는데 장작이 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:348
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Go out and chop wood"
msgstr "나가서 장작을 팬다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:356
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " refuses to eat it!"
msgstr "은(는) 먹기를 거부한다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "The innkeeper serves up an amazing breakfast!"
msgstr "여관 주인이 끝내주는 아침을 차려 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" pays to stay a night at the inn. It's comfortable.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 돈을 내고 여관에서 하룻밤 묵는다. 편안하다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:369
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "No one wants zombies creepin while they're sleepin hhhHHHHHHeheh."
msgstr "자는 동안 좀비가 기어 들어오면 안 되잖아 흐흐흐흐흐흐헤헤."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" gets a better deal for the night.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 더 좋은 조건으로 하룻밤을 얻어 낸다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:375
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "You're a sly one hhhhhhhhhhHHHHHHeheh."
msgstr "꽤 약았구먼 흐흐흐흐흐흐흐흐흐흐헤헤."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:380
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
"...hhhhhhhhhhHHHHHHeheh you must be a big shot.\r\n"
"\t\tI'll show you the presidential suite."
msgstr ""
"...흐흐흐흐흐흐흐흐흐흐헤헤 거물이신가 보네.\r\n"
"\t\t대통령 스위트룸을 보여 드리지."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " makes a "
msgstr "은(는) 낸다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "hhhHHHHHeh"
msgstr "흐흐흐흐흐헤"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " sound."
msgstr " 소리를."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " tells the woman to "
msgstr "은(는) 여자에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "SAY IT NOT SPRAY IT."
msgstr "침 튀기지 말고 말해."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "She shows the Presidential Suite! It's got a spa!"
msgstr "여자가 대통령 스위트룸을 보여 준다! 스파까지 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "She also shows off the Executive Gym!"
msgstr "임원 전용 헬스장도 자랑한다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:401
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "She kicks "
msgstr "여자가 쫓아낸다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:401
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " out. "
msgstr "을(를). "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:401 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " eat"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:401 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " on the road, but never find"
msgstr "길에서 밥을 먹지만, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:401 deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " a secure place to sleep."
msgstr "안전하게 잘 곳은 끝내 찾지 못한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " peels out of there pretty fast. "
msgstr "은(는) 그곳을 재빨리 빠져나간다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:411
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Bed & Breakfast"
msgstr "베드 앤 브렉퍼스트"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" finds an inn, open for business! The owner wrings her hands: \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 영업 중인 여관을 찾는다! 주인이 손을 비비며 말한다: \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Give me 10 food, I'll watch over you while you sleep hhhHHHHHeh."
msgstr "식량 10 주면, 자는 동안 지켜 줄게 흐흐흐흐흐헤."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tShe is super creepy."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t엄청 소름 끼치는 여자다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:416
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Pay the 10 food"
msgstr "식량 10을 낸다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:419
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ": SAY IT DON'T SPRAY IT"
msgstr ": 침 튀기지 말고 말해"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:422
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " haggles it to 5 food"
msgstr "이(가) 식량 5로 깎는다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:440
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ""
" tries to keep spirits high by singing. Whether or not the singing was any "
"good mostly depends on your attitude."
msgstr "은(는) 노래로 사기를 북돋우려 한다. 노래가 좋았는지 아닌지는 듣는 사람 태도에 달렸다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:446
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "It turns out that "
msgstr "알고 보니 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:446
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " really isn't that great at planning things at all."
msgstr "은(는) 계획 세우는 데 영 소질이 없다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " plans out the next day. It's a good use of time, and helps "
msgstr "은(는) 내일 계획을 세운다. 시간을 잘 활용한 덕분에 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:449
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " focus on the big picture."
msgstr "이(가) 큰 그림에 집중할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:452
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " makes elaborate plans for the next day. It's not until morning that "
msgstr "은(는) 내일을 위한 정교한 계획을 세운다. 아침이 돼서야 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:452
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " realizes that the plans were completely goofy."
msgstr "는 계획이 완전 엉터리였다는 걸 깨닫는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:458
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Death Road Sing-a-Long"
msgstr "데스 로드 다 함께 노래를"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:459
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " is sitting around a campfire. Finding this campsite was rough, so "
msgstr "은(는) 모닥불 주위에 앉아 있다. 이 야영지를 찾느라 고생해서, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:459
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid " getting in a bad mood."
msgstr "기분이 점점 나빠지고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:460
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid "Sing a song"
msgstr "노래를 부른다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df:461
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp2.df"
msgid ": Plan out tomorrow"
msgstr ": 내일 계획을 세운다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " ALWAYS has a fire safety plan prepared. It doesn't matter where "
msgstr "은(는) 언제나 화재 대피 계획을 세워 둔다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " is, "
msgstr "가 어디에 있든, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" constantly thinks up new fire safety plans.\r\n"
"\tAll supplies were saved! "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 끊임없이 새로운 화재 대피 계획을 생각한다.\r\n"
"\t물자를 전부 구했다! "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "No one was injured."
msgstr "다친 사람은 없다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" is completely fireproof.\r\n"
"\t\t "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 완벽한 방화 체질이다.\r\n"
"\t\t "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " saves the supplies at a leisurely pace. No hurry!"
msgstr "는 여유롭게 물자를 구해 낸다. 서두를 것 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " escape"
msgstr "은(는) 탈출한다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ", no one is harmed."
msgstr ". 아무도 다치지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " tries to keep calm and observant."
msgstr "은(는) 침착하게 상황을 살피려 한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " can't keep calm at all! "
msgstr "는 전혀 침착하지 못하다! "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " panics!"
msgstr "은(는) 공황에 빠진다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " keeps very calm!"
msgstr "는 아주 침착하다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " panics, and this wastes precious time"
msgstr "는 당황해서 귀한 시간을 허비한다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " plans a fast way out. "
msgstr "는 빠른 탈출로를 계획한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " leave"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " unhurt!"
msgstr "무사히 빠져나간다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " goes the wrong way. "
msgstr "는 길을 잘못 든다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " gets burned!"
msgstr "은(는) 화상을 입는다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " gets away! "
msgstr "은(는) 빠져나간다! "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Who plans and leads the escape?"
msgstr "누가 탈출 계획을 세우고 이끌까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" runs out of that situation. Unfortunately, a lot of supplies got left "
"behind that weren't in the car."
msgstr "은(는) 그 자리를 뛰쳐나온다. 안타깝게도 차에 싣지 않은 물자는 대부분 두고 왔다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Fire!"
msgstr "불이야!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " goes against "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" judgement and camps in a city apartment, because there's no zombies around."
msgstr " 판단을 거스르고, 좀비가 없다는 이유로 도시 아파트에서 야영한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "When "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " wake"
msgstr "이(가) 깨어 보니"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " up, the building is on fire. "
msgstr ", 건물이 불타고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " is cool about fire safety"
msgstr "은(는) 화재 안전에 빠삭하다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Plan out escape"
msgstr "탈출 계획을 세운다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Run out NOW"
msgstr "당장 뛰쳐나간다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " stand"
msgstr "은(는) 밖에서 약탈자들을 경계한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " guard outside for the looters as "
msgstr "그동안 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " searches the grocery store."
msgstr "이(가) 식료품점을 뒤진다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" grabs the food in there and then sneaks away, never to return. What a "
"weasel!"
msgstr "은(는) 안에 있던 식량을 챙겨서 몰래 사라지고, 다시는 돌아오지 않는다. 비열한 놈!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " says there wasn't any food in there."
msgstr "은(는) 안에 식량이 없었다고 말한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " suspects that this is a lie! "
msgstr "은(는) 거짓말이라고 의심한다! "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " starts keeping an eye on "
msgstr "는 감시하기 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " brings back some food!"
msgstr "은(는) 식량을 좀 가져온다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" grabs some cans of food that were on the shelves, avoiding a sparse amount of zombies. Another group of looters come in.\r\n"
"\tThe looters start shooting! They really want those cans of food!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 좀비 몇 마리를 피해 선반에 있던 통조림을 챙긴다. 그때 다른 약탈자 무리가 들어온다.\r\n"
"\t약탈자들이 총을 쏘기 시작한다! 통조림이 정말 탐나나 보다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " runs back to the camp for a fight. They never follow, but "
msgstr "은(는) 싸울 각오를 하고 야영지로 달려 돌아온다. 놈들은 따라오지 않았지만, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " stays up the whole night."
msgstr "은(는) 밤을 꼴딱 새운다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" wisely chooses to not get into a big fight about some cans of food. There "
"will be other grocery stores, with less humans to worry about."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 통조림 몇 개 때문에 큰 싸움을 벌이지 않기로 현명하게 결정한다. 다른 식료품점도 있을 테고, 사람도 더 적을 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Who should loot the grocery store?"
msgstr "누가 식료품점을 털까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " sets up camp outside a grocery store. "
msgstr "은(는) 식료품점 밖에 야영을 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " notice"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " another group has been following "
msgstr "다른 무리가 따라오고 있었다는 걸 알아챈다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " and will probably attempt to loot the place."
msgstr ". 놈들은 아마 이곳을 털려고 할 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:115
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Parking Lot Camping"
msgstr "주차장 야영"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Try to loot the grocery store"
msgstr "식료품점을 털어 본다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Grocery Trust Exercise"
msgstr "식료품점 신뢰 테스트"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Send one person in to loot?"
msgstr "한 명만 들여보내서 털까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Let them have it, avoid trouble"
msgstr "놈들에게 양보하고, 말썽은 피한다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " does not trust anyone in the camp. "
msgstr "은(는) 야영지의 누구도 믿지 않는다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" stays up all night, watching for any signs of trouble. Nothing happens, and"
" "
msgstr "는 밤새 깨어서 문제의 조짐을 살핀다. 아무 일도 없었고, "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:134 deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " is exhausted in the morning."
msgstr "는 아침에 녹초가 된다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " has an easy time robbing the peaceful camp. "
msgstr "은(는) 평화로운 야영지를 손쉽게 턴다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " quickly steals food and then speeds off. "
msgstr "은(는) 재빨리 식량을 훔쳐 달아난다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " drive"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " through the night and "
msgstr "밤새 달려서 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " tired the next day."
msgstr "다음 날 피곤하다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " goes to the middle of the crowded camp and starts "
msgstr "은(는) 북적이는 야영지 한가운데로 가서 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "FARTING UP A STORM."
msgstr "방귀 폭풍을."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " stands on a little box and tells the entire camp to "
msgstr "은(는) 작은 상자 위에 올라가 야영지 전체에 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "COOL IT."
msgstr "진정해."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:152
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
"The other groups in the camp take this as a sign that they should RELAX and "
"CUT LOOSE more and they hold a big feast!"
msgstr "야영지의 다른 무리들은 이걸 '더 느긋하게 즐기라'는 신호로 받아들이고 큰 잔치를 연다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Everyone in the camp almost immediately turns on "
msgstr "야영지의 모두가 거의 즉시 등을 돌린다: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " ejected, and make"
msgstr "쫓겨나서 "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " camp in a much less comfortable spot."
msgstr "훨씬 불편한 곳에서 야영한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:161
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " takes a risk and goes to sleep in the crowded camp."
msgstr "은(는) 위험을 감수하고 북적이는 야영지에서 잔다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Nothing unusual happens."
msgstr "별일 없이 지나간다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
"One of the other groups learns about the trip to Canada. They give some "
"supplies, because they say you'll need it more than they will."
msgstr "다른 무리 하나가 캐나다로 간다는 얘기를 듣는다. 너희가 더 필요할 거라며 물자를 좀 나눠 준다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
"Someone, and we'll never know who, did the hand in warm water prank to "
msgstr "누군가, 누군지는 영원히 모르겠지만, 자는 사이 손을 따뜻한 물에 담그는 장난을 쳤다. 피해자: "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "In the morning, the other groups are gone and supplies are missing!"
msgstr "아침이 되니 다른 무리들은 떠났고 물자가 사라졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " can't bring themselves to trust this many strangers. "
msgstr "은(는) 이렇게 많은 낯선 사람을 도저히 믿을 수 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " decide"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " it's safer to drive away as soon as "
msgstr "되도록 빨리 차를 몰고 떠나는 게 안전하다고 판단한다. "

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " can."
msgstr "떠날 수 있는 대로."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Crowded Campsite"
msgstr "북적이는 야영지"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" finds a large campsite that is occupied by a few carloads of other survivors. Camping with strangers is risky, but there's nowhere else to go.\r\n"
"\tNone are heading to Canada."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차 몇 대 분량의 다른 생존자들이 차지한 큰 야영지를 찾는다. 낯선 사람과 야영하는 건 위험하지만, 갈 곳이 없다.\r\n"
"\t캐나다로 가는 사람은 아무도 없다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Camp with them"
msgstr "함께 야영한다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " doesn't trust them"
msgstr "은(는) 그들을 믿지 않는다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:191
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " robs them and runs"
msgstr "이(가) 털고 도망간다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " tells camp to 'COOL IT'"
msgstr "이(가) 야영지에 '진정해'라고 말한다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Drive off with no sleep"
msgstr "잠 안 자고 차로 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:202
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" spends all night taking stuff apart and putting them back together. It's very noisy.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 밤새 물건을 분해했다 조립했다 한다. 엄청 시끄럽다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:203
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " will be very tired tomorrow!"
msgstr "은(는) 내일 몹시 피곤할 것이다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Who should tinker with the broken machinery?"
msgstr "누가 고장 난 기계를 만질까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Non-Useless Junk Shop"
msgstr "쓸모 있는 고물상"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
" camps in a sturdy building. It seems to be an old repair shop, with busted machinery laying around.\r\n"
"\tThis would be a great time to train with repairing things, but that would make a lot of noise."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 튼튼한 건물에서 야영한다. 오래된 수리점 같고, 고장 난 기계가 널려 있다.\r\n"
"\t수리 연습을 하기에 딱 좋지만, 엄청 시끄러울 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Just go to sleep"
msgstr "그냥 잔다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Tinker all night"
msgstr "밤새 기계를 만진다"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " doesn't care."
msgstr "은(는) 신경 안 쓴다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "The secret ritual has been completed!"
msgstr "비밀 의식이 완료되었다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "Bort has been summoned..."
msgstr "보트가 소환되었다..."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid "The group is full, but Bort has been summoned. Who gets to leave?"
msgstr "일행이 꽉 찼지만 보트가 소환되었다. 누가 떠날까?"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid " gets some shooting practice by blasting the cans."
msgstr "은(는) 깡통을 쏘며 사격 연습을 한다."

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp3.df"
msgid ""
"A man in red long johns runs onto the field with a pitchfork.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"빨간 내복을 입은 남자가 쇠스랑을 들고 들판으로 뛰어든다.\r\n"
"\t\t"
